{"id": 2313, "title": "Puppy and kitten", "japanese_title": "子犬と子猫", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "puppy-and-kitten", "audio_url": "/audio/japanese/2313_puppy-and-kitten.mp3", "english_paragraphs": ["The first time my puppy saw my friend's kitten, it was very scared.", "The second time the puppy saw the kitten, it stood beside the kitten and watched it.", "The third time it saw the kitten, it went over and played with it.", "Soon, they became good friends."], "english_full": "The first time my puppy saw my friend's kitten, it was very scared.\n\nThe second time the puppy saw the kitten, it stood beside the kitten and watched it.\n\nThe third time it saw the kitten, it went over and played with it.\n\nSoon, they became good friends.", "japanese_paragraphs": ["私の子犬が友達の子猫を初めて見たとき、とても怖がりました。", "二度目に子猫を見たとき、子犬は子猫のそばに立って、じっと見ていました。", "三度目に子猫を見たとき、子犬は近づいて、一緒に遊びました。", "まもなく、二匹は仲良しになりました。"], "reading_paragraphs": ["わたし の こいぬ が ともだち の こねこ を はじめて みた とき、 とても こわがりました。", "にどめ に こねこ を みた とき、 こいぬ は こねこ の そば に たって、 じっと みていました。", "さんどめ に こねこ を みた とき、 こいぬ は ちかづいて、 いっしょ に あそびました。", "まもなく、 にひき は なかよし に なりました。"], "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"わたし\" data-defn=\"I/me\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">私</span><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"こいぬ\" data-defn=\"puppy\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N4\"><span class=\"si\">子犬</span><rt>こいぬ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"が\" data-defn=\"subject marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">が</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ともだち\" data-defn=\"friend/companion\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">友達</span><rt>ともだち</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><r